# Databricks notebook source
# MAGIC %md
# MAGIC # UC6 Adaptive-Rec — Smoke Test (50 cases vs the reference report)
# MAGIC Replays the 50 cases from `UC6_AdaptiveRec_SmokeTest` against the deployed endpoint and compares the
# MAGIC suggestion(s) / score / threshold_met to the reference.
# MAGIC
# MAGIC IMPORTANT — the reference was generated on **local Postgres** (property_popularity_v2 / property_centrality).
# MAGIC The Databricks endpoint uses parquet embeddings + **Silver** signals (PERCENT_RANK popularity, graph-degree
# MAGIC centrality). So **relevance (cosine) should match ~exactly** (same embeddings), while popularity/centrality-
# MAGIC driven **scores and the winning pick may differ**. The report separates: pid match, score match, and the
# MAGIC relevance-isolation check — so you can see whether any divergence is embeddings (should be none) vs signals.

# COMMAND ----------
dbutils.widgets.text("endpoint", "onboarding-adaptive-staging")   # client: onboarding-adaptive-staging-v2
dbutils.widgets.text("session_suffix", "")   # set to a run id to force FRESH in-memory sessions on a re-run
